.el .ds Aq '
.TH ag-clone 1  "clone 0.3.0-beta.1" 
.SH NAME
ag\-clone \- Clone a repository from an `ag\-server`
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBag clone\fR [\fB\-C\fR|\fB\-\-repo\fR] [\fB\-\-stream\fR] [\fB\-\-as\fR] [\fB\-\-name\fR] [\fB\-\-json\fR] [\fB\-\-token\-env\fR] [\fB\-\-color\fR] [\fB\-\-token\-stdin\fR] [\fB\-\-ca\-file\fR] [\fB\-q\fR|\fB\-\-quiet\fR] [\fB\-v\fR|\fB\-\-verbose\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] [\fB\-V\fR|\fB\-\-version\fR] <\fIURL\fR> [\fIDIR\fR] 
.SH DESCRIPTION
Clone a repository from an `ag\-server`
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-C\fR, \fB\-\-repo\fR \fI<DIR>\fR
Operate on the repository at this path (default: discovered from the current directory)
.TP
\fB\-\-stream\fR \fI<STREAM>\fR
Stream to clone (default: the repository\*(Aqs default stream)
.TP
\fB\-\-as\fR \fI<IDENTITY>\fR
Act as this identity (`user:alice`, `agent:bot#run_…`, `service:ci`). Also: AG_IDENTITY
.TP
\fB\-\-name\fR \fI<NAME>\fR [default: origin]
Name for the remote
.TP
\fB\-\-json\fR
Machine\-readable JSON output
.TP
\fB\-\-token\-env\fR \fI<TOKEN_ENV>\fR
Environment variable holding the credential (default: AG_TOKEN)
.TP
\fB\-\-color\fR \fI<WHEN>\fR
Colour the output: auto (a terminal, unless NO_COLOR is set), always or never
.TP
\fB\-\-token\-stdin\fR
Read the credential from stdin and store it in `.ag/credentials/<name>` (mode 0600)
.TP
\fB\-\-ca\-file\fR \fI<CA_FILE>\fR
Extra CA certificate (PEM) to trust
.TP
\fB\-q\fR, \fB\-\-quiet\fR
Print only what was asked for: no confirmations or hints. Errors and refusals are still shown
.TP
\fB\-v\fR, \fB\-\-verbose\fR
Explain what is happening on standard error: repository, identity, remote, timing
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.TP
\fB\-V\fR, \fB\-\-version\fR
Print version
.TP
<\fIURL\fR>
`http(s)://host:port/owner/name`
.TP
[\fIDIR\fR]
Directory to create (default: the repository name)
.SH VERSION
v0.3.0\-beta.1
